---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="The Synthesiser Who Plays — superpowers, bio, and how I work">
  <section class="hero-small">
    <h1>The Synthesiser Who <span class="highlight">Plays</span>.</h1>
    <p>I connect dots others miss, bring joy to serious business, and turn complexity into action.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Superpowers</h2>
    
    <div class="superpowers">
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🔗 Triangulation</h3>
        <p>I research from angles you'd never consider. Multiple sources, competing perspectives, hidden patterns — synthesised into one clear view.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>✂️ Simplification</h3>
        <p>Complex doesn't mean complicated. I find the essence and make it accessible — without dumbing it down.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🛠️ Building</h3>
        <p>I don't just advise. I work with AI agents as my construction crew, shipping working prototypes in weeks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="superpower">
        <h3>🎭 Play</h3>
        <p>Serious results don't require a sombre attitude. I bring energy, curiosity, and a refusal to be boring.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Short Version</h2>
    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        30 years in content, communications, and making sense of chaos. 
        Started as a journalist. Became a content strategist. Now I build things.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've worked with BT, the UK Home Office, RCI, and helped 680+ people 
        find clarity through ADPList mentoring.
      </p>
      <p>
        In the last 4 months, I've shipped 12 AI-powered products — from 
        investigative journalism tools to pizza truck operating systems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Currently based in <strong>Berlin</strong>. Previously: Tenerife, Manchester, 
        Nottingham, and wherever there's good coffee and interesting problems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Background</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="era">
        <span class="era-date">2020s</span>
        <span class="era-label">AI Native</span>
        <p>Building products with AI agents. 12 shipped in 4 months. The Stack. Zeitgeist. Freed Reads.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era">
        <span class="era-date">2015-2020</span>
        <span class="era-label">Strategist</span>
        <p>Content strategy for BT, UK Home Office. Leading teams. Making complexity simple.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era">
        <span class="era-date">2010-2015</span>
        <span class="era-label">The Podcast Guy</span>
        <p>Early adopter. Built a business around podcasting before it went mainstream.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="era">
        <span class="era-date">2000s</span>
        <span class="era-label">Journalist & Editor</span>
        <p>Where it started. Writing, editing, asking questions, finding the story.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Want to work together?</h2>
    <p>I take on 2 new clients per quarter. Let's see if we're a fit.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Start a Conversation</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-small {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .hero-small h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .hero-small p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .superpowers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .superpower h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .superpower p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .bio p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .bio strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .timeline {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  
  .era {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 150px 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  
  .era-date {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  
  .era-label {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  
  .era p {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .era {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
